	I play nethack all the time, and it interferes with my school work 
quite  often.  About a week ago, I obtained a highscore, of what I 
considered quite high for me, of about 17,000 points.  Many of you out 
there are probably laughing at me, but please don't, as I've only been 
playing for about 3/4 of a year and I still am quite bad.  I've only 
made it to the zoo once, and died, never beaten Sokoban (got to the 2nd 
to last lev. though, then got stuck), never made it to the quest, and 
never gotten any super-special items.  Just today, though, I played 
through an amazing game as a Val-Hum-Law, where I found a lawful altar 
on the first dungeon level, started sacking a bunch, only to 
accidentally sac a wererat, massively pissing off my god to no end.  I 
don't remember why now, but I prayed, and he sent a coatl to try to kill 
me.  Being only on Xp lv 3, I ran.  I then made it very far, skipping 
the gnommish mines and Sokoban, and making it to dungeon lev 7 with Xp 
lev 10.  My friend and I are both amateurs, and we like to try to beat 
eachothers highscores, so I figured I would try to escape the dungeon to 
create a massively highscore for him to beat.  So I turned around and 
headed back to the entrance, slaughtering everything in my path.  I made 
it to the first level with ease (even though i was very jumpy from 
eating a water nymph) and killed the coatl and my cat, (had to be done 
:( ), and started to sac somemore, in hopes of pleasing my god.  I did 
so unsuccessfully, and for some reason ended up praying again, only to 
have him send another coatl, which I killed rather quickly.  But before 
I could make it up the steps to freedom, a giant ant killed me after 
destroying all my scrolls and potions.  I think I need major playing 
advice.  Here's my dump file:

